[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600300_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600300_01_0010","text":"今晚好大的浪啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600300_01_0020","text":"路加，小时候在海边玩过吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600300_01_0030","text":"没什么"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600300_01_0040","text":"你看，就是在沙滩上画画什么的。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600300_01_0050","text":"用这种棍子，这样……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600300_01_0060","text":"哈哈，画好了！\n是西瓜的画。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600300_01_0070","text":"无聊死了。\n那种东西─────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600300_01_0080","text":"是吗？\n我觉得画得还挺好的────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600300_01_0090","text":"啊……海浪……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600300_01_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600300_01_0100","text":"…………"}]
